991	{"artifactId":"ISSUE-bd1c6c9005ff6390","entry":{"id":"de8a2c97","text":"Scope narrowed on the stakeholder's decision (2026-10-17, after LLD review rounds 1-3): this ISSUE fixes the TypeScript/JavaScript parser's calls outside any extracted function (program-level statements including every test('...', () => { ... }) body, exported and module-level initializers, export default, class field initializers and constructor bodies), plus isTestFile recognising the Python, Go and JVM test conventions. Call extraction for Python and Go, Java/Scala/Kotlin class-body and initializer contexts, JVM callee naming, and same-package and test-to-main call resolution move to a new Story in Epic c2ba6fa6, defined from the three review rounds' findings. The fix intent's 'other language parsers' clause is discharged by that Story.","actor":{"id":"legacy:subho-ghosh","kind":"person","properties":{"name":"Subho Ghosh"}},"timestamp":"2026-10-17T08:55:14.342Z","feedback":[],"kind":"revision-request"}}
